rooms_desc ({"The room is very sunny, and it has a lovely view of the whole valley, thefurniture has been chosen to match the Japanese stile of the house.On the western wall you can see a Katana and a Tachi, and a very oldpicture of an old Japanese master.There is a name cut it in. The name is:               **********************************                   'O-Sensei Morihei Uyeshiba'               **********************************   On the eastern side of the room is a small Japanese table, and on thewestern side is a big bed. In the northern side of this room you can seea chest of drawers. There is something written on it in Nihonese.On the floor is a very expensive wall to wall carpet.","You are in a very romantic bedroom with an open fireplace.In the southern side of the room is a low, wide, springy bed manufacturedfrom heavy wood, and covered with a big white silk bedspread.Above the bed, on the wall you can see a beautiful picture with Alisa'sand Uyeshiba's portrait.On the western side of the room is an unusually big mirror, and beside themirror is a coffe table with a fragment of 'Kalcit' on it.On the floor you can see a very expensive soft Persian carpet.","You find yourself in the Uyeshiba's Meditation room. On the floor you can see a big black wall to wall carpet. This is a pretty dark room.On the northern side of the room you can see a sign hanging on the wall,with the following text on it :***************************************************************************** YOU ARE NOT ALLOWED TO FIGHT IN THE UYESHIBA'S MEDITATION ROOM  ! ! !    ** IF YOU TRY TO FIGHT HERE YOU WILL BE PUNISHED BY GODS !                     *****************************************************************************On the eastern side of the room you can see a big chest of drawers.There is something writen on it in Nihonese.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Ninja Uyeshiba's house","Ninja Uyeshiba's bedroom.","Ninja Uyeshiba's Meditation room.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
